<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">KOLOSE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan ola baal a Kolose</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolose</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolose</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu eli ntam Pool. Ndɛ áswɛn ndɛ onse bwal, sua mvel wu ãku-ãsɛɛn y'ɔ̃mɔ̃ (61), bvool áyuɔɔl ndɛ ol'akiool b'Ebvɔɔn li bviil li Kolose. Wu ábal Ebvɔɔn olɔ ke Pool wɛ. Wu ábal lɔ Epafalas wu oli ngɔmɔ̃ onse andoo a ndɛ b'ɔ̃sal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:7">1.7</ref></char>). Pool ábɔɔ ãnsia mi ɛ̃tsab mi ɛ̃kelɔ baal b'áketee ãtee mã mfya onse akiool ba bviil olɔ. M'ãtee omɔ̃, bɔ áketam akiool k'akuru nzuru m'okɔɔ b'Ayuda. Pool bu aswɛn bɔ ɔ̃nkaan wu me ndɔɔ yi ayeel bɔ ãndɔɔ mã nkiin m'ãtal Nsia yi Ngesɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:20-23">2.20-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Akoo k'akab ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ebaal bviaal:</para>
  <para style="io">Onse ebaal ki ɛ̃kwel, Pool abio akiool, abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:1-11">1.1-11</ref></char>), bvool ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Mãsia y'ɔ̃sal a ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:12-23">1.12-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ hɛ̃ ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãmvel m'ebedzwaan ndɛ kwɛn Nsia yi Ngesɛ eyi nkwel ke bviil li Kolose ye li Lahodise (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:24-2:5">1.24–2.5</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ bvool ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a Mãsia ŋ'esuo ndɛ kwɛn «onziã bam bueel obekal onse ndɛ bvool oluul nzuru a ndɛ». Ndɛ asuo kwɛn onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mãsia, bia-byɛ emeebvuul, bvool «ndɛ ádzeel ɔ̃nkaan wu ákefɛn bia-byɛ, wɛn m'áswɛn onse ndɛ k'ã́ketsweel bia-byɛ wɛ. Ndɛ ámbaal ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ ŋ'ébɛɛl ndɛ ndɛ m'enkulusu» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:6-19">2.6-19</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Onse ebaal ki bviaal, ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan asuo emfa ki ekal akiool (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:20-3:17">2.20–3.17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ bvool ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ emfa ki akal onse yam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 3:18-4:6">3.18–4.6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ osɛɛl ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ m'ãtee mã ntɔ y'olɛɛl b'akiool (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4.7-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ntam a Yeso Mãsia, m'emfa ki edzii Nziã. Mɛ̃ ye ndoo wu Timote, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />eswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ol'andoo b'ali ke Kolose, b'ali ba ngel bvool b'akuru nzuru me Nziã onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mãsia: Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ asio byɛ nyiĩ, awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obveel o Nziã ãtuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Bee ebebveel Nziã wu Tal a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia ãtuɛɛn, ŋ'ebebuɛɛn bee me ndɔɔ a byɛ lio lueel. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bee eyoo k'ayɛɛn m'okiool o byɛ me Mfam Yeso Mãsia, bvool me dzii li eli a byɛ me ndɔɔ a ba ngel bueel, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eli ye kaã me ki ákwee byɛ ke ywel. Kaã olɔ li ébɔɔ byɛ, ŋ'éyoo byɛ Endɔɔ li otaa-taa, Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Nsia oyɔ ebeburu nsia bvool ebetsɔɔn m'ɔ̃kiri wueel. M'emfa okyɛ yɔ emeetɔ ola byɛ, fa lio li éyoo byɛ yɔ bvool éyɛɛ nyiĩ a Nziã onse otaa-taa bueel. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Epafalas wu ndoo a bia-byɛ wa dzii bvool wu abesal ye bee, wu áyiool byɛ Nsia oyɔ. Ndɛ oli ɔ̃sal a Mãsia bvool abesal m'emfa ki dzu me ndɔɔ a byɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Ndɛ owi bee nsia a dzii li ewi Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal byɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãbuɛɛn me ndɔɔ Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bɛɛn tsoo li eyoo bee nsia oyɔ, bee k'ebeyɔɔl k'ebuɛɛn Nziã me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. Bee ebesɔɔ ola ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ asa kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ mbueel m'edzii ndɛ, ŋ'ewa ndɛ byɛ ontwel bueel y'ãyal m'ɔ̃koo me nkuul a Ɔ̃fel. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Obobɔ, byɛ edzuu m'emfa ki edzii Mfam, bvool esa mbueel m'ãwa ndɛ esɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ èburu nsia yi mvɛ yi eli ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ mi emfa bwɛn emfa bvool byɛ èkwel onse oyɛɛ o Nziã. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Nziã àwɛɛl byɛ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel me mpɛn a lweel e ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ekoo k'ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ y'okuru b'ɔ̃kwal onse ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Y'esɛ kieel, ebveel ãtuɛɛn ola Taal, wu ásuul kwɛn byɛ ekoo k'ebɔɔ boo li ɔ̃swal wu ékwee ndɛ ba ngel onse mwiĩ. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Ndɛ opaal bia-byɛ onse okwɛn b'empeel, me ndɔɔ yi abiri bia-byɛ onse okwɛn o Muaan a ndɛ wa dzii. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Me nkuul a ndɛ, bia-byɛ ebɔɔ obvuul bvool ebɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mãsia y'ɔ̃sal wu ési ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Mãsia oli m'emfa ki eli Nziã wɛn k'abemwɛn wɛ. Ndɛ oli Muaan wu ɛ̃kwel, wa ke ywel a bvieel bvi ési Nziã. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me nkuul a ndɛ ábuo bvieel bvi eli ke ywel ye bvi me nsie, bvi abemwɛn ye bvɛn k'abemwɛn wɛ, ekal akwɛn, ekal amfam, ekal waan, ekal mpɛn. Eluɔ bvieel ábuo bvɛ me nkuul a ndɛ bvool me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Ndɛ, ndɛ oli ke nkwel a bvieel, bvool me nkuul a ndɛ bvam bvieel etɛɛn k'ãmboo ã bvɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ndɛ, ndɛ oli ɔ̃tswɛ a nzuru a ndɛ. Nzuru oyɔ eli Ebvɔɔn. Ndɛ oli obɛɛn bvool oli mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu ásiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, kwɛn ndɛ akal wu ɛ̃kwel onse ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã omwɛn ngesɛ k'asa kwɛn onziã bam bueel okal onse ndɛ, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />bvool kwɛn me nkuul a ndɛ, ndɛ abveel ondoo y'eluɔ bvieel ye ndyam, ekal bvi me nsie, ekal hɛ̃ bvi ke ywel, me ndɔɔ yi alɔ opi me nkuul a ndɛ, m'ãkel m'enkulusu e ndɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Byɛ hɛ̃ tsɔɔn éli lala ye Nziã bvool éli ataal a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ ãtsam ã byɛ m'ãbi ãbi y'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ byɛ mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Meba ŋã, ndɛ obveel ondoo ye byɛ m'epfu e Muaan a ndɛ onse nzuru y'ombuul, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyetɛɛn ke nkwel a ndɛ onge baal ba ngel, b'aywɛn elyal bvool bɛn mbyel pyɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Kɛn ebvaan kwɛn byɛ esɛn ãnã bvool etɛɛn ye mpɛn onse okiool. Ebee nkuul owa yi abiri byɛ lala ye kaã li ébɔɔ byɛ ŋ'éyoo byɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ. Nsia oyɔ, átee yɔ ola baal bueel b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie, Nsia yɛn mɛ̃ wu Pool éyii ɔ̃sal a yɔ.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal a Pool me ndɔɔ a Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Meba ŋã, mɛ̃ esia mpaa m'ãmpal m'emwɛn mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Onse nzuru a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ embɛɛl ki eywɛn onse ãmpal ã Mãsia me ndɔɔ a nzuru a ndɛ. Nzuru oyɔ eli Ebvɔɔn. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Mɛ̃ ndyam éyii ɔ̃sal Ebvɔɔn olɔ me pfuũ li éwi Nziã mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi etee byɛ Endɔɔ e ndɛ m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Ndɔɔ oyɔ yi éli m'edziɔɔn ol'ãyam mbueel m'ãlio mbueel m'ã́bwel. Kɛn a meba, ndɛ oyɛɛl yɔ ola baal a ndɛ ba ngel. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã ádzii k'asa kwɛn bɔ ayɛɛ opfel o lweel e ndɔɔ yi éli m'edziɔɔn me ndɔɔ a baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. Ndɔɔ oyɔ, yɔ bu: Mãsia onse byɛ, eli kaã lɛn byɛ ekal onse lweel. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ndɛ wu Mãsia, wu ebetee bee, ewa ãnkunkwa bvool etee mbuul wueel y'ãyal mbueel, me ndɔɔ yi ebiri mbuul wueel k'akal ɔ̃koo onse Mãsia. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Obɔ otsɛn b'ebesal mɛ̃ bvool ebedzwaan me mpɛn a ndɛ yi ebesal ye waan lueel onse mɛ̃.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ ebedzwaan mvel yi kokɔ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, me ndɔɔ andoo ba bviil li Lahodise ye bam bueel bɛn lɔɔ-okal kɛn a mwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Mɛ̃ ebedzwaan m'emfa okyɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃luul me mpɛn, bvool kwɛn bɔ akal onse bvoo onse dzii, bvool kwɛn bɔ aluul bam m'opfel b'ãyal. M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ ol'akoo k'ayɛɛ ndɔɔ a Nziã yi m'edziɔɔn. Ndɔɔ oyɔ, eli Mãsia. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Onse ndɛ, ákwee opfel bueel b'ãyal ye b'oyɛɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn obobɔ, kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee byɛ opfuru m'ãyɛɛn m'opɛɛn. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Onkyam ŋɛn me nzuru mɛ̃ ke ndi mboo mɔ̃ ye byɛ wɛ, kɛn a m'ɔ̃fel mɛ̃ ndi ye byɛ, bvool mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ ki emwɛn byɛ etɛɛn ye mpɛn onse okiool o byɛ me Mãsia.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wu abewa elaã Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Obobɔ, onge bɛn byɛ eyɔɔ Mfam Yeso Mãsia, edzuu onse bvoo ye ndɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Yɔɔl kwɛn byɛ elɔ ɛ̃dza bvool etuu elaã e byɛ nkal a ndɛ, ewam onse okiool m'emfa ki átee byɛ, bvool eluul me tuɛɛn. <verse eid="COL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Ekal y'onkyab kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee byɛ tuo e ndɛ okaal m'ãyal m'ombuul m'ãngwel-a-ngwel bvool mã pfuru, m'ãfa onse onkɔɔ o baal bvool onse ãndɔɔ m'ãbebiri ɔ̃kiri wu. Ãyal omɔ̃ k'ãfa ola Mãsia wɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onziã bam bueel obekal onse ndɛ bvool oluul nzuru a ndɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Onse ndɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ eli ye bvieel m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo. Ndɛ wu oli mfam a okwɛn bueel bvool wa waan lueel.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Onse Mãsia, átsiil byɛ. Otsiil obɔ, ke bo me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal wɛ, bɔ ofi ola ndɛ. M'otsiil obɔ, ŋ'apaal byɛ onse ombuul b'ãbi. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ádziool byɛ ye ndɛ me nkuul a opongo, bvool byɛ ésiool ye ndɛ m'okiool onse waan e Nziã li éseel ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Byɛ bɛn tsɔɔn éli baal b'ákwi me ndɔɔ elyal e byɛ, bvool bɛn k'átsiil wɛ. Kɛn a Nziã áseel byɛ ye Mãsia, ŋ'émbaal ndɛ elyal e byɛ bvieel. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Ndɛ ádzeel ɔ̃nkaan wu ákefɛn bia-byɛ, wɛn m'áswɛn onse ndɛ k'ã́ketsweel bia-byɛ wɛ. Ndɛ ámbaal ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ ŋ'ébɛɛl ndɛ ndɛ m'enkulusu. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã ámbaal mpɛn a ɛ̃fel mi y'okwɛn ye mi ye waan. Ndɛ ásuo myɛ̃ ke nkwel a baal bueel, bvool ákedzuru myɛ̃ onge baal a bwal b'ásiin ke mvel ŋ'ébvel Muaan a ndɛ bɔ m'enkulusu.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul abee byɛ me mbyel obam me b'otal bvi-odza wuo me b'otal ki onywã, wuo me b'otal pfuun ke lɛn, me b'otal nswii wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn wuo me b'otal ãtsoo ã saba. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel ã́li kɛn edzel-a-dzel b'obvɛ b'okeya, otaa-taa o mɔ̃ omɔɔn onse Mãsia. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Yɔɔl kwɛn baal b'asa empa ki akal y'okuaal o nzuru, b'abebuɛɛn ãnzwel bvool abelɔ dzuun onse emwɛn e bɔ, abee byɛ me mbyel obam. Bɔ ali y'ondɛɛl o nzuru bo ngwel-a-ngwel m'ãtsam ã bɔ m'ombuul. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Bɔ k'abekuru nzuru me Mãsia wu oli ɔ̃tswɛ wɛ. Kwɛn ŋɛn ɔ̃tswɛ, wu abesa kwɛn nzuru ekwel m'emfa ki edzii Nziã bvool ebvɔɔn mboo mɔ̃ m'atel ye tuo.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwa y'osiool ye Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Byɛ ékwi ye Mãsia, m'emfa okyɛ byɛ émeembal ke nsɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãbebiri ɔ̃kiri wu. Oŋɔ̃ otsɛn omã bvool b'ekal byɛ onge bɛn elaã e byɛ kɛn ekuru nzuru m'ɔ̃kiri wu, ŋ'ekiool byɛ k'elweel ãngel mã: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />«Oyɛɛ ke wal! Oyɛɛ ke mbio! Oyɛɛ ke kwaal!» <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Ãngel omɔ̃ mbueel ãtal eluɔ bvi ebebii ke mbee a ŋ'amasa ɔ̃sal me bvɛ. Omɔ̃ eli kɛn ãngel y'ãtee m'ombuul. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ke yam ãngel omɔ̃ ãli k'emfa onge m'ãwa ãyal. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɔ̃ ãtam kwɛn mbuul abuɛɛn m'emfa ki edzii ndyam, akal y'okuaal o nzuru b'opfuru-opfuru bvool atuaal nzuru mpal. Kɛn ãngel omɔ̃ k'ãli y'otsɛn wɛ, mɔ̃ ãtam kɛn k'asa ãndɔɔ m'edzii efua bvi ombuul.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Obobɔ, onge bɛn byɛ esiool ye Mãsia, ebii eluɔ bvi ke ywel, ke mboo yi eli Mãsia me nsɛn ke kuɔɔl e Nziã ki elam. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Etsam m'ãndɔɔ mã ke ywel, ke mã me nsie wɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ emeekwa, bvool elaã e byɛ eli m'okwɛɛ ye Mãsia onse Nziã. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ŋ'ekieel emɔɔn Mãsia, ndɛ wu oli elaã e byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ ekieel emɔɔn ye ndɛ onse lweel e Nziã.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elaã li tsɔɔn y'elaã li alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Obobɔ, ebam ãndɔɔ mbueel mã nsie mã, m'ãli onse elaã e byɛ: Ãndɔɔ m'esio, ãndɔɔ mã mbiin, efua bvi ãndɔɔ m'opfuru, efua bvi ebi-ebi, ɔ̃tam, wu oli obuɛɛn b'anziã ba mfya. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Eli me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ k'eya mpuru a Nziã [nkal a baal b'abee k'alweel ndɛ]<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ oyɔ k'eli onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn.</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Byɛ hɛ̃ tsɔɔn ékesa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, me lio li ékekal byɛ onse mɔ̃.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Kɛn a meba ŋã, byɛ hɛ̃, eyɔɔl ãndɔɔ mã mbueel: Mpuru, odza o lɔɔl, ãndɔɔ m'ãbi, ɛ̃tswɛ, ye siaal lɛn ekoo k'epal m'ɔ̃nywã a byɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Ebee bakyɛ opfuru, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ émeeyiri ombuul o byɛ bo tsɔɔn, y'epfuũ e bɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Byɛ emeelaal ombuul b'alili b'obekɔɔl onyiɔɔn, b'ébuo Nziã m'emfa e ndyam. Obobɔ, byɛ èyɛɛ ndɛ m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Okam k'obekal wɛ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ Ɔ̃yuda ye wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda wɛ, mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a bɔɔl wu amaatsiil ye wɛn kɛn atsiil wɛ. K'ebekal y'ɔ̃senzi wɛ, y'ɔ̃nzii wɛ, y'ɔ̃nkyal wɛ, ye mbuul wa ndii wɛ. Kɛn a Mãsia wu oli y'otsɛn, bvool oli onse byɛ bueel.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Obobɔ, onge bɛn byɛ eli baal bɛn Nziã ásueel, baal ba ngel, bvool bɛn ndɛ odzii, ekal y'ɔ̃kwal wa nyiĩ, ɔ̃kwal wu odzii k'asa obvɛ, y'okuaal o nzuru, y'efyɛ, y'osɛ-mwiĩ. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Ekal y'okuru b'ɔ̃kwal ye bakyɛ. Okɛɛn wumɔ̃ osi obi, edzeel ndɛ. Onge b'edzeel Mfam byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ esa emfa kiki. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Ke ywel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ bueel, ekal ye dzii. Lɔ li ebvool baal m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Yɔɔl kwɛn opi o Mãsia b'áti byɛ mbel ke bɔ k'ekal nzuru ngamɔ̃, okal y'okwɛn onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ! Ekal ye tuɛɛn! <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Endɔɔ e Mãsia ekal onse byɛ y'opfel o lɔ bam bueel! Etee bvool edzuru bakyɛ ãtswi y'ãyal mbueel, m'ãnziĩ m'emfa bwɛn emfa m'ãfa ol'Ɔ̃fel. Eyam Nziã y'obveel b'ãtuɛɛn onse ɛ̃kwal. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Ãndɔɔ mbueel m'esa byɛ wuo m'eyɛɛn byɛ, esa mbueel me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso, bvool me nkuul a ndɛ, ebveel ãtuɛɛn ola Nziã wu Taal.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki akal onse yam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Akal, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul awa ɔ̃lam a ndɛ dzuun m'emfa ki ebvaan onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Alam, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn adzii ɔ̃kal a ndɛ, bvool abee y'epfuũ bvi mpɛn-mpɛn okal ke nkwel a ndɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Baan, elweel aburu a byɛ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi esa Mfam esɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Atal, ebee baan a byɛ mpuru owa, kwɛn bɔ nzuru ebee osool.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Asal, ewa amfam a byɛ ba nsie ŋã dzuun m'ãndɔɔ mbueel. Ebee bɔ dzuun owa kɛn a me lio li ekyab bɔ byɛ, me ndɔɔ yi esa bɔ esɛ. Kɛn ewa bɔ dzuun onse ɔ̃kwal a byɛ ondɛɛl o nzuru pyɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ elweel Mfam.<verse eid="COL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Ãndɔɔ mbueel m'esa byɛ, esa mɔ̃ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, nzal-a-ŋɛn byɛ esa mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a Mfam, ke me ndɔɔ a baal wɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Eyɛɛ wɛn, byɛ ekieel ebɔɔ ɔ̃swal onge furu li ewa Mfam. Esa ɔ̃sal a Mfam wu Mãsia. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu asa obi, akieel abɔɔ furu li obi b'esa ndɛ. Ola Nziã ɔ̃bɛɛ pyɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Byɛ b'amfam, ekal y'asal a byɛ m'emfa ki dzu bvool ki ekoo, eyɛɛ wɛn byɛ hɛ̃ eli ye Mfam ke ywel.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãluo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Ebuɛɛn owɔɔl wɛ, m'okal y'onkyab onse ãbuɛɛn y'obveel b'ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Ebuɛɛn hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a bee, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ Nziã adzweel bee nkuul yi eyetee Endɔɔ e ndɛ, yi etsal nsia a ndɔɔ a Mãsia yi m'edziɔɔn. Me ndɔɔ a ndɔɔ oyɔ, mɛ̃ ndi onse bwal. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ntee yɔ kal-a-kal m'emfa ki ekoo. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Ekal y'ãyal ye bɛn k'ali akiool wɛ. Lio lueel li ebɔɔ byɛ mpwee, esa obvɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Yɔɔl kwɛn ãyɛɛn ã byɛ ãsuo nyiĩ bvool ãkal y'obvie ãlio mbueel, kwɛn byɛ ekoo k'eyɛɛ emfa ki ewa mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ɔ̃mveel.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃lɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tiswik àwa byɛ ãnsia mbueel m'ola mɛ̃. Ndɛ oli ndoo a bee wa dzii, oli ɔ̃sal wu okuru nzuru me Nziã bvool oli ndoo a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃sal onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Mɛ̃ eyuɔɔl byɛ ndɛ bvel-bvel kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ ãnsia m'ola bee bvool kwɛn ndɛ awɛɛl ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Mɛ̃ eyuɔɔl ndɛ y'Onedzime wu okuru nzuru me Nziã bvool wu oli ndoo a dzii. Ndɛ oli ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ. Bɔ àliaal byɛ mbueel m'ãbebwel kwɛn.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Alisitaake, ndoo a mɛ̃ wa bwal, obio byɛ. Maak wu muaan-ngoo a Balanabas obio byɛ hɛ̃. Amaawa byɛ luo me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu Maak, ŋɛn ndɛ oyi ola byɛ, eyɔɔ ndɛ ngesɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yeso wu ata me Dzisitus obio byɛ hɛ̃. Onse baal b'átsiil, b'abesal ye mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã, eli kɛn a bɔ ange-atyel. Bɔ baal b'awi mɛ̃ mpɛn.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafalas wu oli ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal a byɛ, obio byɛ. Ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia ondɛ abedzwaan kɛn odzwaan me ndɔɔ a byɛ onse ãbuɛɛn ã ndɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ byɛ esɛn ãnã, ekal ɔ̃koo, bvool ekiool ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃ k'esa mbueel m'edzii Nziã. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu Epafalas, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɛ abesal kokɔ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, me ndɔɔ a baal ba bviil li Lahodise bvool me ndɔɔ a baal ba bviil li Hielapolis. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luk wu ndoo a bia-byɛ wa dzii wu ɔ̃boo, ye Demas abio byɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Ebio andoo b'ali ke bviil li Lahodise. Ebio Nɛmfa hɛ̃, y'ebvɔɔn li eli onse nzɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ŋ'eman byɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu otsiɔ ola byɛ, esa kwɛn atsiɔ ndɛ hɛ̃ k'ebvɔɔn li Lahodise. Byɛ hɛ̃ etsiɔ wu àfa Lahodise. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Eliaal Aaswipe ndiri: «Kal y'onkyab m'ɔ̃sal wu éwi Mfam yɛ, me ndɔɔ yi asa ndɛ ngesɛ.»<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ mbio byɛ, myam mbuul wu nswɛn byɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu me kuɔɔl e myam. Ebee odzɛɛn wɛn me ndi onse bwal. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asio byɛ nyiĩ!<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>